Package: spark-store-tui
Version: 0.9.1-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Xynrin <xynrin@163.com>
Depends: ca-certificates, aptss | spark-store
Recommends: chafa, sudo
Homepage: https://gitee.com/spark-store-project/spark-store-tui
Description: Native terminal UI for Spark Store software management
 Spark Store TUI is a Go terminal interface for browsing official Spark Store
 metadata and searching applications. Debian package download, verification,
 installation, selected-app updates and removal are delegated to aptss.
 .
 Interrupted aptss/aria2 downloads are recovered on the next start.
